**ai**: Qdrant builds an open-source vector search engine for AI retrieval, and its Berlin openings include an ML Engineer / Python developer-tooling role. **Flags:** Qdrant's core is written in Rust, which Hsan hasn't used; Qdrant Cloud runs on AWS/GCP/Azure, which he also hasn't used; qdrant.tech/careers returned a 404, so the open roles come from job sites ([arbeitnow](https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/qdrant/machine-learning-engineer-python-developer-berlin-158815), [Indeed](https://de.indeed.com/cmp/Qdrant/jobs)) and may be out of date.
